  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together the pilaf, aerated, mildly, and eggs.",
    "3. Stir in the corn, melted butter, and chopped fresh dill (if using).",
    "4. Using a 1/4 cup measuring cup, scoop the mixture into balls.",
    "5. Flatten each ball slightly into a disk shape.",
    "6. Place the disks on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "7. Bake for 20-25 minutes, or until the fritters are golden brown and crispy.",
    "8. Serve hot and enjoy!"
